    - target: {fileID: 2859147190401906338, guid: b16424dcc3deba241b1457370a8e5b5e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Each song will play three times:


        First Round: Try playing
        the notes you hear.

        Second Round: Time to improvise! Use the blues
        scale to create your own melody.

        Third Round: Again, play along
        with the notes you hear.


        Your performance is scored based on how
        accurately you follow the notes and how well you stay within the blues scale
        when improvising!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
